  "result": "Perfect! All 71 tests pass. Here's what I've added:\n\n**New error codes in `src/errors.js`:**\n- `LINE_NOT_FOUND`: That SKU is not on this invoice.\n- `NOT_DRAFT`: Cannot modify an invoice that is not in draft status.\n\n**`addLine(invoice, { sku, qty })`** \u2014 Adds or updates a line on a draft invoice:\n- If the SKU already exists, increases its qty\n- If the SKU doesn't exist, adds it as a new line enriched with catalogue data\n- Validates qty is a positive integer\n- Validates the SKU exists in catalogue\n- Returns error if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**`removeLine(invoice, sku)`** \u2014 Removes a line from a draft invoice:\n- Returns `LINE_NOT_FOUND` if the SKU isn't on the invoice\n- Returns `NO_LINES` if it would remove the last line (invoice must have at least one)\n- Returns `NOT_DRAFT` if invoice status isn't 'draft'\n- Never mutates the input\n\n**Tests (19 new, 71 total):**\n- `addLine`: new/update lines, validation, non-mutation, draft status, building multi-line invoices\n- `removeLine`: removal, validation, error cases, sequential removals, non-mutation",
